//Add new Remodded-specific features as they get added. To keep track.

[THIS IS IN ADDITION TO NEARLY ALL THE FUNCTIONALITY OF AMNESIA:TDD 1.5, ANYTHING THAT'S DIFFERENT WILL BE NOTED HERE:]
ᒪ Skybox cubemaps are not fully confirmed to be fixed, but they should be. (i couldn't notice any difference during testing)
ᒪ ShowLocalCustomStoriesOnly doesn't really work in 1.5 anyway, and its redundant here, so now it does extra nothing.
ᒪ Custom story full conversions have been changed to actually launch the full conversion. (noticed some weird behavior in vanilla from my testing.)
ᒪ Whatever the changes to slime areas were, are not present here.

----------------------------
----  SCRIPT FUNCTIONS  ----
----------------------------

+ OnLoad() callback

+ SetTinderboxes(int alAmount)
+ AddTinderboxes(int alAmount)
+ int GetTinderboxes()

+ RemoveNote(string& asNameAndTextEntry)
+ RemoveAllNotes()
+ RemoveDiary(string& asNameAndTextEntry, int alEntryIdx)
+ RemoveDiaries(string& asNameAndTextEntry)
+ RemoveAllDiaries()
/ changed AddDiary to return the exact entry index it adds.
ᒪ int AddDiary(string &in asNameAndTextEntry, string &in asImage)

+ bool CheckEntityLineOfSight(string &in asEntity1, string &in asEntity1, bool abCheckShadows)
+ float GetLightLevelAtPos(float afX, float afY, float afZ, float afRadius)

+ bool GetLampLit(string &in asName)
+ DeleteEntity(string &in asName) [Supports wildcards * ]

+ SetCurrentLantern(string &in asLantern)
+ const string& GetCurrentLantern()
+ SetCurrentHands(string &in asHands)
+ const string& GetCurrentHands()

+ float GetEntityRotationX(string &in asName, int body)
+ float GetEntityRotationY(string &in asName, int body)
+ float GetEntityRotationZ(string &in asName, int body)

+ SetEntityRotation(string &in asName, float afrX, float afrY, float afrZ, int body)
+ SetEntityRotationAndPosition(string &in asName, float afrX, float afrY, float afrZ, float afpX, float afpY, float afpZ, int body)

+ AttachPlayerCameraToEntity(string &in asEntity)
+ DetachPlayerCamera() [Legacy, does the same as AttachPlayerCameraToEntity("");]

+ ForceSave(string &in asFile) [I don't recommend using anything but "AutoSave" and "HardMode" for asFile, but it's there for fine control.]
+ bool GetHardmodeEnabled()

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

-----------------------------
----   ENGINE FEATURES   ----
-----------------------------

+ Option toggle for OpenAL Soft HRTF (only really to turn it off, engine doesn't properly support it.)
+ custom entity crosshairs now save

+ Lamp->Light connections now support "Multiply" connection type

+ Multiple lanterns support.
+ Multiple hands support.

+ New Lantern item type variables
ᒪ "LanternUseHandObject" type bool
ᒪ "LanternHandObject" type string

+ New HandObject file (.ho) variables, exclusive to LightSource hand object type
ᒪ "OnSound" type string
ᒪ "OffSound" type string
ᒪ "NoOilSound" type string
ᒪ "DisabledSound" type string [Seems to be unused, in-engine.]
ᒪ "FuelDrainSpeed" type float
|
ᒪ They will default to their corresponding values inside game.cfg if not set.